  "summary_en": "Book review in the European Journal of Risk Regulation of the 2024 Cambridge Handbook on law, policy and regulation for human-robot interaction. It praises the interdisciplinary, cross-cultural coverage of personhood, ethics, tort, criminal and tax law, while noting Western bias, jargon, overlap and weak treatment of enforcement.",
