   "Handbook covers legal personhood, ethics, culture, and civil/criminal liability for human-robot interaction.",
   "Highlights value-sensitive design and ethical standardisation for robot governance.",
   "Relevant to European regulators designing future-proof digital regulation.",
   "Criticises Western-centric coverage and limited discussion of enforcement and political feasibility.",
   "Notes repeated reliance on Asimov's laws and the UAE citizenship of Sophia."
